---
import { ArrowRight, Zap } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section class="py-14 md:py-24 relative overflow-hidden" style={{ background: "#070B18" }}>
  {/* Glow */}
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none"
    style={{
      background: "radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(124,58,237,0.18) 0%, transparent 65%)",
    }}
  />
  <div
    class="absolute left-0 right-0 h-px top-0"
    style={{ background: "linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(124,58,237,0.4), transparent)" }}
  />

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
    <div
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border mb-8"
      style={{
        background: "rgba(0,229,160,0.08)",
        borderColor: "rgba(0,229,160,0.25)",
      }}
    >
      <Zap size={14} style={{ color: "#00E5A0" }} />
      <span style={{ color: "#00E5A0", fontFamily: "'Manrope Variable', sans-serif", fontSize: "0.82rem", fontWeight: 600 }}>
        Start free · No credit card needed
      </span>
    </div>

    <h2
      class="mb-6"
      style={{
        fontFamily: "'Bricolage Grotesque Variable', sans-serif",
        fontWeight: 800,
        fontSize: "clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4rem)",
        color: "#EEF2FF",
        letterSpacing: "-0.03em",
        lineHeight: 1.05,
      }}
    >
      Your Competitors Are Already{" "}
      <span
        style={{
          background: "linear-gradient(135deg, #7C3AED, #00E5A0)",
          WebkitBackgroundClip: "text",
          WebkitTextFillColor: "transparent",
        }}
      >
        Ranking Above You.
      </span>
    </h2>

    <p
      class="mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto"
      style={{
        fontFamily: "'Manrope Variable', sans-serif",
        color: "#8899BB",
        fontSize: "1.1rem",
        lineHeight: 1.7,
      }}
    >
      Every day with an unoptimized listing is a day of lost sales. Join many sellers who flipped the switch and watched revenue climb.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="/dashboard/signup"
        class="flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 hover:scale-105"
        style={{
          background: "linear-gradient(135deg, #7C3AED, #5B21B6)",
          color: "#fff",
          fontFamily: "'Manrope Variable', sans-serif",
          fontWeight: 700,
          fontSize: "1rem",
          boxShadow: "0 0 40px rgba(124,58,237,0.5)",
        }}
      >
        Start Optimizing Free <ArrowRight size={18} />
      </a>
    </div>

    <p
      class="mt-8"
      style={{ fontFamily: "'Manrope Variable', sans-serif", color: "#4B5568", fontSize: "0.85rem" }}
    >
      Optimize 3 listings free • No credit card required • Cancel anytime
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
